  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>tigecycline</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>J01AA12</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Bastida C et al. 2022</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>critically ill patients with decompensated cirrhosis and severe infections</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>tigecycline</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_tigecycline/Tigecycline_Bastida2022_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>clearance (CL)</td><td>14.8</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>intercompartmental clearance (Q)</td><td>38.4</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr><tr><td>central and peripheral volumes of distribution (V1 and V2)</td><td>63.7</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr></table><h4>About tigecycline</h4><p>Tigecycline is a tetracycline antibiotic used to treat bacterial infections, including pneumonia and complicated skin, soft tissue, and intra-abdominal infections. It is authorised in the European Union and used mainly in hospital settings for serious bacterial infections.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q420595\">Wikidata Q420595</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Tigecycline\">Tigecycline</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Bastida C et al. (2022). Tigecycline population pharmacokinetics in critically ill patients with decompensated cirrhosis and severe infections. <i>The Journal of antimicrobial chemotherapy 77(5):1365–1371</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/jac/dkac036\">10.1093/jac/dkac036</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35178567\">35178567</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Bastida_2022: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
